      "final": "All 6 tests pass.\n\n**Summary of fixes in `time_math.py`:**\n\n1. `parse_client_instant`: removed the manual `parsed - offset` subtraction. `fromisoformat` already preserves the UTC offset in the tzinfo; calling `astimezone(timezone.utc)` alone is sufficient. The old code subtracted the offset *then* converted again, double-shifting by the UTC offset.\n\n2. `minutes_before`: replaced `start.replace(minute=start.minute - minutes)` with `start - timedelta(minutes=minutes)` so subtraction correctly crosses hour (and day) boundaries.\n\nTests run: 6 (`test_dispatch_scheduler.DispatchSchedulerContractTests`). No prior experience id used.",
